Rule 1 (tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 2 (tensor should not contain zero values for log2 operation)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 ∧ ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : v_1[i] ≠ 0
>>
Rule 6 (index tensor (v_2) should be within the range of input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= min(v_2) ≥ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : max(v_2) ≤ shape(v_1, i) - 1
>>
Rule 22 (primitive type variable should not be zero)
{v_1 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≠ 0
>>
Rule 31 (list of bools for masking or selection)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : list(bool)} |= v_2.len = shape(v_1, 0)
